OL,3,ATrump says Iran war is 'effectively
OL,4,Aover' militarily with further strikes
OL,5,Aunlikely
OL,6,
OL,7,FAddressing reporters from the White
OL,8,FHouse press briefing room, Trump said
OL,9,Fthat renewed US attacks on Iran were
OL,10,F"highly unlikely" but that the US was
OL,11,F"locked and loaded" should the
OL,12,Fcircumstances change.
OL,14,FIranian officials have repeatedly
OL,15,Fexpressed doubts about the US
OL,16,Fpresident's prior comments about
OL,17,Fresolving the conflict.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
